# User data stays on the device and is never committed. This covers the local
# database in data/, its SQLite sidecar files, and the temp file used for
# atomic writes. The dev server recreates data/ on first run, so nothing needs
# to be tracked for the app to work. The patterns below also catch a stray
# database outside data/.
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite.tmp
coverage/
.DS_Store
.next/
out/
